sequenceDiagram
    participant API as /husk/llm-translation
    participant H as husk()
    participant P as _pick_target
    participant C as OpenAI client
    participant B as LLM backend
    API->>H: husk(input, crumb_level, options)
    Note over H: crumb_level discarded
    H->>P: _pick_target(input, options)
    alt target_domain set
        P-->>H: free-text domain
    else target_id set
        P-->>H: catalog domain or ValueError
    else default
        P-->>H: sha256(input) mod catalog
    end
    H->>C: chat.completions.create(system + user)
    C->>B: HTTP request
    alt connection or timeout
        B-->>C: error
        C-->>H: APIConnectionError / Timeout
        H-->>API: raise BackendUnavailable (502)
    else finish_reason == length
        B-->>C: truncated
        H-->>API: raise RuntimeError (500)
    else ok
        B-->>C: completion
        H->>H: strip code fence
        H-->>API: (output, meta)
    end
